# UFO/UAP Knowledge Graph & Visualization System

## System Overview

This document outlines a unified AI agent system for processing, analyzing, visualizing, and storing UFO/UAP research data. The system creates a comprehensive pipeline that handles everything from entity extraction to interactive 3D visualizations.

## Core Components

### 1. Knowledge Graph Generator

The foundation of the system is a robust knowledge graph infrastructure that processes structured entity data and transforms it into visual network maps.

```javascript
// Core knowledge graph generation pipeline
function generateKnowledgeGraph(entities, relationships) {
  // Generate nodes from extracted entities
  const nodes = entities.map(entity => ({
    id: entity.id,
    type: entity.entityType,
    data: { 
      label: entity.name || entity.title,
      ...entity 
    },
    position: calculateOptimalPosition(entity),
    style: getStyleForEntityType(entity.entityType)
  }));
  
  // Generate edges from extracted relationships
  const edges = relationships.map(rel => ({
    id: `edge-${generateUniqueId()}`,
    source: rel.source,
    target: rel.target,
    type: rel.relationType,
    data: { 
      label: formatRelationshipLabel(rel.relationType),
      ...rel.metadata
    },
    style: getStyleForRelationshipType(rel.relationType)
  }));
  
  return { nodes, edges };
}
```

